   │                    ╰───── this recursive call might not terminate: no argument is known to be smaller
   │ 
   │ Note 1: `match k + 0 with` matches a computed value, so what its patterns bind isn't seen as a part of `k`: if the recursion is on a part of `k`, match `k` itself (`match k with`), or give a measure with `decreasing`
